sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant FE as Next.js
  participant API as FastAPI chat/stream
  participant CS as ChatService
  participant DB as SQLite history
  participant LLM as Qwen/Gemini
  participant LG as LangGraph
  participant OSSIE as OSSIE compiler
  participant IMP as Impala

  User->>FE: Question + session_id
  FE->>API: POST /api/chat/stream
  API->>CS: stream
  CS->>DB: load last turns
  CS->>LLM: understand_turn
  CS->>LG: governed pipeline
  LG->>OSSIE: plan metric/dimensions
  LG->>LG: validate SQL
  LG->>IMP: SELECT read-only
  IMP-->>LG: rows
  LG->>LLM: analyze + chart_spec
  CS->>DB: append turn
  CS-->>FE: SSE done
  FE-->>User: Answer + chart + table
